appwiz.cpl: fetch Gecko and Mono over https.

**"Download failed." on the device, 2026-09-17, and the same request hangs from
a desktop.** `http://source.winehq.org` accepts the connection, takes the
request, and never answers:

    * Established connection to source.winehq.org (2606:4700:...) port 80
    > GET /winemono.php?arch=arm64&v=11.3.0&winev=11.0 HTTP/1.1
    * Request completely sent off
    (nothing, until the timeout)

The same URL over https answers immediately:

    HTTP/1.1 302 Found
    Location: http://dl.winehq.org/wine/wine-mono/11.3.0/wine-mono-11.3.0-arm64.msi

It worked the day before, so this is WineHQ's front end changing under us rather
than anything here. urlmon reports INET_E_DOWNLOAD_FAILURE, appwiz shows its
IDS_DOWNLOAD_FAILED box, and nothing says which hop died -- the failing one is
the redirector, not the download: `dl.winehq.org` still serves the .msi over
plain http, which is what the redirect points at and what the phone fetched by
hand while the dialog was on screen.

Both addons move, because both use the same front end and Gecko would fail the
same way the day something needs it.

**TLS is available on this target**, which is the part worth checking rather
than assuming: `crypt32`'s unixlib reads `/etc/security/cacerts` for Android
(dlls/crypt32/unixlib.c:628), and the device has 145 certificates there, so
`InternetOpenUrlW` can verify the chain. Vessel also points
`WINE_ADDITIONAL_CERTS_DIR` at the container's own `certs/` directory for
anything the user adds.

`get_url()` appends the query parameters to any URL beginning "http", so "https"
still gets `?arch=...&v=...&winev=...` -- no other change is needed.

diff --git a/dlls/appwiz.cpl/addons.c b/dlls/appwiz.cpl/addons.c
index aed8043..a56e05b 100644
--- a/dlls/appwiz.cpl/addons.c
+++ b/dlls/appwiz.cpl/addons.c
@@ -113,7 +113,7 @@ static const addon_info_t addons_info[] = {
         L"wine-gecko-" GECKO_VERSION "-" GECKO_ARCH ".msi",
         L"gecko",
         GECKO_SHA,
-        "http://source.winehq.org/winegecko.php",
+        "https://source.winehq.org/winegecko.php",
         L"MSHTML", L"GeckoUrl", L"GeckoCabDir",
         MAKEINTRESOURCEW(ID_DWL_GECKO_DIALOG)
     },
@@ -123,7 +123,7 @@ static const addon_info_t addons_info[] = {
         L"wine-mono-" MONO_VERSION "-" MONO_ARCH ".msi",
         L"mono",
         MONO_SHA,
-        "http://source.winehq.org/winemono.php",
+        "https://source.winehq.org/winemono.php",
         L"Dotnet", L"MonoUrl", L"MonoCabDir",
         MAKEINTRESOURCEW(ID_DWL_MONO_DIALOG)
     }
